# TaskOutput Banned

**NEVER use TaskOutput or read task output files.**

For subagent progress, use Scribe logs: `read_recent(project="...")` or `query_entries(...)`.
For team coordination, use TaskList/TaskGet to check task status.
Scribe is always the audit trail; TaskList is only for real-time team task tracking.
